{"id":960,"slug":"shadows-in-paradise","title":"Shadows in Paradise","year":1986,"country":"Finland","duration":74,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/960-shadows-in-paradise","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/ecf3feaffeb272d4813d78b9a9df9b3c/x6inKLlvsx0ZpS2F8SDRT52VJjeqyK_large.jpg","description":"Lonely garbageman Nikkander (Matti Pellonpää) finds himself directionless after losing his friend and co-worker to a sudden heart attack; unlikely redemption comes in the form of plain supermarket cashier Ilona (Kati Outinen, in her first of many performances for Kaurismäki), with whom he begins a tentative love affair. Boiling down what is essentially a romantic comedy to a series of spare and beautiful gestures, Kaurismäki conjures an unexpected delight that finds hope blossoming even amid gray surroundings. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Aki Kaurismäki","slug":"aki-kaurismaki"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Matti Pellonpää","role":"Nikkander","slug":"matti-pellonpaa"},{"actor":"Kati Outinen","role":"Ilona Rajamäki","slug":"kati-outinen"},{"actor":"Sakari Kuosmanen","role":"Melartin","slug":"sakari-kuosmanen"},{"actor":"Esko Nikkri","role":"Co-worker","slug":"esko-nikkri"},{"actor":"Kylli Köngäs","role":"Ilona’s girlfriend","slug":"kylli-kongas"},{"actor":"Pekka Laiho","role":"Shop steward","slug":"pekka-laiho"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Aki Kaurismäki","slug":"aki-kaurismaki"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Mika Kaurismäki","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Aki Kaurismäki","slug":"aki-kaurismaki"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Timo Salminen","slug":null},{"role":"Art direction","person":"Pertti Hilkamo","slug":null},{"role":"Art direction","person":"Heikki Ukkonen","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Raija Talvio","slug":null},{"role":"Sound","person":"Jouko Lumme","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[594,364,961],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[1000564]}